# Documentation updates

## Always (substantive code or content changes)

1. **`CHANGELOG.md`** — Add a bullet under `[Unreleased]` (or the current version): `Added` / `Changed` / `Fixed` / `Removed`, [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/) style.

## When relevant

2. **`tech_readme_files/`** — Update the guide that matches what changed (navigation, DI, contact, deployment, localization, etc.). Use `tech_readme_files/DOCUMENTATION_MAP.md` to pick the right file.

This repo does **not** use `DOCUMENTATION_UPDATE_SUMMARY.md` or `CURRENT_STATUS.md` (those were from another project template).
